This project's research framework is inspired by the open-source
TradingAgents project. StockSenate is an independent implementation and does
not include TradingAgents source code; behavioural compatibility is limited to
the public `propagate` contract described in README.md.

TradingAgents-astock is referenced for behavioural comparison only.

StockSenate performs research analysis and backtest simulation only. It does
not place orders, connect to brokerages, or produce executable trading
instructions.
